  "details": "Kinda a stretch but a shyness/sensory mode where you can temporarily go invisible, hiding your name tag and avatar, as well as muting your mic so you can get to a quieter part of the world, this would be toggle able by world creators to prevent game world cheating. You could also as a play set it if you still wanna be able to see and hear other players, or set it so groups of people (friends/specific users) can still hear and see you, so you can interact with your friends still while hiding from the rest of the lobby. I know it's very much a stretch, but honestly as a very shy person, I would like a way to completely hide myself from the server with the exception of a few select people I really trust.",
